{"versions":[{"path":"versions/3a5c286c-46e6-4f4b-afe7-25e490acc377/e318c9a35f4f028db15e2e8587bf3b2a58dffc6de47ba296685198dad4e088ba.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"3a5c286c-46e6-4f4b-afe7-25e490acc377","revision":"sha256:e318c9a35f4f028db15e2e8587bf3b2a58dffc6de47ba296685198dad4e088ba","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"A researcher wants to test whether mean systolic blood pressure (SBP) differs among three groups of adults following different diets using one-way ANOVA:"},{"type":"table","headers":["Group","n","SBP (mmHg)"],"rows":[["A (Low-salt)","5","118, 122, 119, 121, 120"],["B (Regular)","5","130, 128, 132, 129, 131"],["C (High-fat)","5","135, 138, 134, 136, 137"]],"align":["left","right","left"]},{"type":"text","content":"Please perform the test and draw a conclusion (alpha = 0.05, keep two decimals during your calculation)."}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"$H_0:\\mu_A=\\mu_B=\\mu_C$. 组均值为 120.00,130.00,136.00, 总均值 128.6667. $SS_B=653.3333$, $SS_W=30$, 自由度分别为 2,12, $MS_B=326.6667$, $MS_W=2.5$, $F=130.6667\\approx130.67$. 临界值 $F_{0.95}(2,12)=3.8853$, 拒绝 $H_0$, 至少一组总体均值不同"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"采用单因素 ANOVA, 假设各个体独立, 组内残差近似正态且方差相等. 总体检验显著不代表任意两组均显著, 两两比较需另做相应检验"}]}}},{"path":"versions/1727c599-9816-45d8-84b4-533d4f0135aa/0fa8801252a1c0da1552a3b8b90d9b8dd9052b7c9d1b9e6099eb852a9220758b.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"1727c599-9816-45d8-84b4-533d4f0135aa","revision":"sha256:0fa8801252a1c0da1552a3b8b90d9b8dd9052b7c9d1b9e6099eb852a9220758b","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"Please examine whether age (x) is linearly associated with systolic blood pressure (SBP, y)."},{"type":"table","headers":["Patient","Age (x, years)","SBP (y, mmHg)"],"rows":[["1","20","118"],["2","25","121"],["3","30","127"],["4","35","130"],["5","40","135"],["6","45","142"]],"align":["left","right","right"]},{"type":"text","content":"(1) Please define your model ${y = bx + a}$. \n(2) Please use F-test to determine if age is significantly associated with SBP (alpha = 0.05)."}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"(1) 模型 $y_i=a+bx_i+\\varepsilon_i$, 拟合式 $\\hat y=98.190476+0.942857x$\n\n(2) $S_{xx}=437.5$, $S_{xy}=412.5$, $SST=394.833333$, $SSR=388.928571$, $SSE=5.904762$. $H_0:b=0$, $H_1:b\\ne0$, $F=SSR/[SSE/(6-2)]=263.467742\\approx263.47$, $df=(1,4)$. 临界值 7.7086, 拒绝 $H_0$, 年龄与 SBP 有显著线性关联"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"斜率 $b=S_{xy}/S_{xx}$, 截距 $a=\\bar y-b\\bar x$; F 检验基于独立, 同方差, 正态误差的线性模型"}]}}}]}